{"title":"Mothsilk Torso","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 56) · Monster drop: Warchief Ruk Gorehand, Baby Red Dragon, Young Red Dragon</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 56 <span class=\"muted\">(7266 XP)</span> from 2× <a href=\"#/item/moth-silk\">Moth Silk</a>, 8× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 1 of 98 looted corpses (1/98)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/98<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"young-red-dragon\" title=\"Young Red Dragon - dropped it in 1 of 487 looted corpses (1/487)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Young Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/487<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"baby-red-dragon\" title=\"Baby Red Dragon - dropped it in 1 of 1,251 looted corpses (1/1,251)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7aca051983df137719ab.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Baby Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,251<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"mothsilk-torso\">Show where to get it on the map</button>